              "type": "heading",
              "text": "2. GroupBy Is Lazy",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "`df.groupby('city')` only builds a ==DataFrameGroupBy== object",
                "No data is computed at that point",
                "Work starts on an ==aggregation==, ==transform==, ==apply== or **iteration**",
                "One row per group, indexed by the key"
              ],
              "style": "dot",
              "frame": "dashed",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "code",
              "lang": "python",
              "lines": [
                "df.groupby('city')['sales'].sum()"
              ],
              "note": "Series indexed by city",
